      "evidence_summary": "Table 6 gives only the number of counties with a project ('14 of 15'). No county breakdown appears in the main text or appendix; the appendix county figure (Figure 4) concerns listings, not projects. Section 2 notes that small rural projects may be less likely to be covered, so a county ranking over 43 projects from one year is exposed to coverage differences. The ranking is a descriptive claim, and I do not request further subgroup analysis. The issue is that the claim rests on numbers that are not shown.",
