          "correspondence": "visual",
          "verification_note": "Inspected the Figure 3 plot region: points near 35% in 2020, a dip in late 2023, a gap in 2024, and about 44% at the last point. The page-16 text for the axis is scrambled, so the image was used. Values read from the image are approximate."
        }
      ],
      "claim_evidence_links": [
